# Personal/local state — device labels, serials, per-device catalog
# copies, and migration working files. Everything generated at
# runtime lives under state/ so it's all in one visible place; none
# of it is shared across machines/repos.
#
# Exception: *_layout.tsv is the curated home-screen layout tree (real
# design work, not disposable per-run state) — worth versioning like
# templates/*.tsv is. Everything else under state/migration/ (pulled
# APKs, package scans, generated backups, caches) stays ignored.
state/*
!state/migration/
state/migration/*
!state/migration/*_layout.tsv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.DS_Store
